  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-septiembre-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{9-x^2}4\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\).",
     "(1,75 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), la recta \\(x+2y=5\\) y el eje de abscisas. Calcula el área de dicho recinto."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(1)=2,\\qquad f'(x)=-\\frac x2\\Rightarrow f'(1)=-\\frac12,\\qquad y-2=-\\frac12(x-1)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=-\\dfrac x2+\\dfrac52\\), es decir, \\(x+2y=5\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(x+2y=5\\) es la tangente del apartado a): toca a la parábola en \\((1,2)\\) y corta al eje en \\((5,0)\\); la parábola corta al eje en \\((3,0)\\). El recinto va de 1 a 5 bajo la recta:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='85.0,53.9 87.9,55.4 90.8,56.8 93.7,58.2 96.6,59.6 99.4,61.0 102.3,62.4 105.2,63.8 108.1,65.3 111.0,66.7 113.9,68.1 116.8,69.5 119.7,70.9 122.6,72.3 125.4,73.7 128.3,75.2 131.2,76.6 134.1,78.0 137.0,79.4 139.9,80.8 142.8,82.2 145.7,83.6 148.6,85.1 151.4,86.5 154.3,87.9 157.2,89.3 160.1,90.7 163.0,92.1 165.9,93.5 168.8,94.9 171.7,96.4 174.6,97.8 177.4,99.2 180.3,100.6 183.2,102.0 186.1,103.4 189.0,104.8 191.9,106.3 194.8,107.7 197.7,109.1 200.6,110.5 203.4,111.9 206.3,113.3 209.2,114.7 212.1,116.2 215.0,117.6 217.9,119.0 220.8,120.4 223.7,121.8 226.6,123.2 229.4,124.6 232.3,126.1 235.2,127.5 238.1,128.9 241.0,130.3 243.9,131.7 246.8,133.1 249.7,134.5 252.6,136.0 255.4,137.4 258.3,138.8 258.3,138.8 255.4,138.8 252.6,138.8 249.7,138.8 246.8,138.8 243.9,138.8 241.0,138.8 238.1,138.8 235.2,138.8 232.3,138.8 229.4,138.8 226.6,138.8 223.7,138.8 220.8,138.8 217.9,138.8 215.0,138.8 212.1,138.8 209.2,138.8 206.3,138.8 203.4,138.8 200.6,138.8 197.7,138.8 194.8,138.8 191.9,138.8 189.0,138.8 186.1,138.8 183.2,138.8 180.3,138.8 177.4,138.8 174.6,138.8 171.7,138.8 168.8,134.6 165.9,130.5 163.0,126.5 160.1,122.6 157.2,118.8 154.3,115.0 151.4,111.4 148.6,107.9 145.7,104.4 142.8,101.1 139.9,97.8 137.0,94.7 134.1,91.6 131.2,88.6 128.3,85.8 125.4,83.0 122.6,80.3 119.7,77.7 116.8,75.2 113.9,72.8 111.0,70.5 108.1,68.3 105.2,66.1 102.3,64.1 99.4,62.2 96.6,60.4 93.7,58.6 90.8,57.0 87.9,55.4 85.0,53.9' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,46.0 22.8,45.3 25.6,44.8 28.4,44.3 31.3,43.9 34.1,43.7 36.9,43.5 39.7,43.4 42.5,43.3 45.4,43.4 48.2,43.6 51.0,43.8 53.8,44.2 56.6,44.6 59.4,45.1 62.2,45.7 65.1,46.4 67.9,47.2 70.7,48.1 73.5,49.1 76.3,50.1 79.1,51.3 82.0,52.5 84.8,53.8 87.6,55.3 90.4,56.8 93.2,58.4 96.0,60.0 98.9,61.8 101.7,63.7 104.5,65.6 107.3,67.7 110.1,69.8 113.0,72.0 115.8,74.3 118.6,76.7 121.4,79.2 124.2,81.8 127.0,84.5 129.8,87.3 132.7,90.1 135.5,93.0 138.3,96.1 141.1,99.2 143.9,102.4 146.8,105.7 149.6,109.1 152.4,112.6 155.2,116.1 158.0,119.8 160.8,123.5 163.7,127.4 166.5,131.3 169.3,135.3 172.1,139.4 174.9,143.6 177.7,147.9 180.5,152.3 183.4,156.7 186.2,161.3 189.0,165.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='28.7,26.4 154.3,87.9 280.0,149.4' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='85.0' cy='53.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='55.0' y='47.9'>(1,2)</text><circle cx='171.7' cy='138.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='159.7' y='154.8'>(3,0)</text><circle cx='258.3' cy='138.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='246.3' y='154.8'>(5,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 138.8H294.0M41.7 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='85.0' y1='135.8' x2='85.0' y2='141.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='152.8' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='128.3' y1='135.8' x2='128.3' y2='141.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='125.3' y='152.8' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='215.0' y1='135.8' x2='215.0' y2='141.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='152.8' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='38.7' y1='96.4' x2='44.7' y2='96.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='25.7' y='100.4' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='38.7' y1='53.9' x2='44.7' y2='53.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='25.7' y='57.9' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_1^5\\frac{5-x}2\\,dx-\\int_1^3\\frac{9-x^2}4\\,dx=4-\\frac14\\Bigl[9x-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_1^3=4-\\frac14\\cdot\\frac{28}3=4-\\frac73=\\frac53\\]<p>(El primer término es un triángulo de base 4 y altura 2.)</p><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac53\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
