  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-septiembre-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el sistema de ecuaciones con tres incógnitas \\[\\begin{cases}x-y=\\lambda\\\\2\\lambda y+\\lambda z=\\lambda\\\\-x-y+\\lambda z=0\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Clasifícalo según los distintos valores del parámetro \\(\\lambda\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Resuélvelo para \\(\\lambda=0\\) y \\(\\lambda=-1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&-1&0&\\lambda\\\\0&2\\lambda&\\lambda&\\lambda\\\\-1&-1&\\lambda&0\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\0&2\\lambda&\\lambda\\\\-1&-1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2 \\lambda^{2}+\\lambda+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0- \\lambda+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\lambda^2+2\\lambda=2\\lambda(\\lambda+1)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq0,-1\\)<b>:</b> compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> la 2.ª ecuación es \\(0=0\\) y quedan \\(x-y=0\\), \\(-x-y=0\\) (homogéneo), con \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1\\\\-1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\neq0\\): rango 2. <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1\\\\0&-2\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1&-1\\\\0&-2&-1\\\\-1&-1&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0-1+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-2+1+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq0,-1\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\lambda=0\\) o \\(\\lambda=-1\\): compatible indeterminado</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(x-y=0\\), \\(-x-y=0\\Rightarrow x=y=0\\), con \\(z\\) libre.</p><p>\\(\\lambda=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(x-y=-1\\), \\(-2y-z=-1\\). Con \\(y=t\\): \\(x=t-1\\), \\(z=1-2t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=0\\): \\((0,0,t)\\). \\(\\lambda=-1\\): \\((t-1,\\ t,\\ 1-2t)\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
