   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla el punto simétrico de \\(P(2,1,-5)\\) respecto de la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(\\begin{cases}x-z=0\\\\x+y+2=0\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(x=t\\), \\(z=t\\), \\(y=-2-t\\). Pasa por \\((0,-2,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(1,-1,1)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(1,\\ -1,\\ 1)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x-y+z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(P(2,\\ 1,\\ -5)\\): \\(2-1+(-5)+D=0\\iff D=4\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x-y+z+4=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[(t)-(-2-t)+(t)+4=0\\iff 3t+6=0\\iff t=-2\\]\\[M(-2,\\ 0,\\ -2)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{2+a}2=-2,\\qquad\\frac{1+b}2=0,\\qquad\\frac{-5+c}2=-2\\]\\[a=-6,\\qquad b=-1,\\qquad c=1\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":28,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.701,5.115,1.816],[-7.115,-1.299,1.816],[-3.299,-5.115,-5.816],[3.115,1.299,-5.816]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-3.299,-5.115,-5.816],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-1.827,-0.173,-1.827],[-1.591,-0.114,-2.003],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-1.591,-0.114,-2.003],[-1.765,0.059,-2.177],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-3.293,1.293,-3.293],[-0.707,-1.293,-0.707],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-0.707,-1.293,-0.707],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[-1.654,-0.346,-1.654],[-1.019,-0.981,-1.019],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[-2.471,-0.118,-1.647],[-1.836,-0.753,-1.012],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[2.0,1.0,-5.0],[-6.0,-1.0,1.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[2.0,1.0,-5.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2.0,0.0,-2.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-6.0,-1.0,1.0],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='185.9,90.2 131.6,18.0 26.0,173.8 80.3,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='173.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='101.1' y1='129.4' x2='99.9' y2='134.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='99.9' y1='134.6' x2='104.7' y2='137.3' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='141.7' y1='151.7' x2='70.1' y2='112.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='76.1' y='112.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='96.4' y1='126.7' x2='78.8' y2='117.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m12sb4d)'/><text x='82.8' y='113.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='108.3' y1='121.5' x2='90.8' y2='111.8' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m12sb4n)'/><text x='96.8' y='121.8' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n<